{"name":"Mildura","hex":"#667960","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Mildura","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A city in north-west Victoria, Australia, situated on the Murray River and close to the border with New South Wales.","A local government area in north-west Victoria, which includes the city proper; in full, the Rural City of Mildura."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Mildura"}],"entries":[{"title":"Mildura","blocks":[{"text":"Mildura is a regional city in north-west Victoria, Australia. Located on the Victorian side of the Murray River, Mildura had a population of 35,652 at the 2021 census. When nearby Wentworth, Irymple, Nichols Point, Merbein and Red Cliffs are included, the combined urban area had a population of 58,914 in 2021, having grown marginally at an average annual rate of 1.3% year-on-year over the preceding five years."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Deakin_Ave_from_Fifteenth_looking_north.jpg/330px-Deakin_Ave_from_Fifteenth_looking_north.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mildura","wikidata":"Q705829"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Rio_Vista%2C_Mildura%2C_Australia.jpg/500px-Rio_Vista%2C_Mildura%2C_Australia.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Rio_Vista%2C_Mildura%2C_Australia.jpg/1280px-Rio_Vista%2C_Mildura%2C_Australia.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Rio_Vista%2C_Mildura%2C_Australia.jpg/500px-Rio_Vista%2C_Mildura%2C_Australia.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARio_Vista%2C_Mildura%2C_Australia.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wik